# Root build context: an allowlist. The root also holds data/ (crawl, PDFs), secrets/ and .env, which must stay out;
# only the workspace and the profiles enter the image builds.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/
!apps/
!profiles/
!models/
!web/page/
web/page/tests
web/page/node_modules
web/page/**/.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
